# Caster101 — Complete Project Context

Live at **https://caster101.xyz** | GitHub: `Caster-101-real-` | Deployed on Vercel

## Stack
- Single `index.html` SPA (no framework) + standalone pages (`bag.html`, `treasury.html`, `mint.html`, `market.html`, `howto.html`, `book.html`)
- `api/*.js` — Vercel serverless functions (ES modules unless noted)
- `@vercel/blob` — snapshot cache for market + treasury data
- Upstash Redis (KV) — Caster Valley cloud saves + leaderboard (`KV_REST_API_URL`, `KV_REST_API_TOKEN`)
- Games: `caster-valley-3d.html` (main game), `awizard-game.html` (secret game), `game/index.html`

