## Pricing Pipeline (summary)

### Chia prices: Dexie tickers (vol>0) → Spacescan fallback → Dexie best-ask → mcap = supply×price
### Base prices: DexScreener batch (incomplete) → per-token (reliable) → Gecko gaps-only → Gecko pools for zero-pair tokens
### Spread: `(base − chia) / chia × 100`. Positive = cheaper on Chia. BYC/Wiz pairing: both keys → `wiz`
### Market cap priority (Base): dex fdv → gecko fdv → implied → gecko supply×price

