- Chia: `xch10na8nqys9afs0fl74vvd6xl3akgu77p8mvjsp2ywy7rhq2s0jqys3nf7dl`, `xch1g477lha2wjjq9634kgqmryf4gplft9cjgv2vd29tq3ya26glwlkqp6pyex`, `xch1el40ydk4v2ccdq2l8d28wvr8hnndar0xywfgqel36f85ps8gj9jqfrm64j`

**treasury-comprehensive.js** (per-wallet):
- Base: Blockscout ERC20 list → DexScreener prices → RPC batch calls (token0/token1/getReserves/totalSupply) for LP valuation
- Chia tokens: Spacescan xch-balance (fast) + token-balance (25s, may 429 rate-limit)
- Chia NFTs: Spacescan nft-balance + MintGarden enrichment (parallel batches of 8)
- `?chain=chia&type=full` → sequential W1+W2 token fetches with 2s gap between them

**treasury-index.js** snapshot:
- Memory 2min, blob SWR 30min
- If blob has no CATs (Spacescan blocked Vercel IPs) → serve partial + queue rebuild
- NFT data preserved from prior blob if server rebuild gets 0 NFTs

## Caster Valley Game (`caster-valley-3d.html`)

Cozy farming/crafting browser game. Loaded in an iframe inside the `valley` tab.

**Game mechanics:**
- Resources: Spellpower (SP / Essence), HP, XP, Level
- Activities: farming, mining, fishing, crafting, feeding dragon
- Skill tree: Bounty I–V (SP mult), other stat upgrades
- Achievements with SP rewards
- Day/night cycle (CSS body class `night-mode`)

**Save system:**
- Local: `localStorage` key `castervalleys1` (auto-save every 10s)
- Cloud: `POST /api/caster-valley-save?deviceId={id}` (debounced, Upstash KV key `cv:save:{deviceId}`)
- Load: compares cloud `savedAt` vs local — uses whichever is newer
- Migration: `SAVE_MIGRATIONS` object, versioned saves (`SAVE_VERSION = 2`)

**Leaderboard:**
- `POST /api/caster-valley-leaderboard` — upserts entry `{ deviceId, name, level, totalEssenceEarned }`
- Score only goes up (never decremented)
- Name sanitized: max 20 chars, no `<>"` 
- KV key `cv:leaderboard` = JSON object keyed by deviceId; top 50 returned sorted by essence

**Normie integration (`game-index.js`):**
- Scrapes `https://www.normies.art/normiecard?id={normieId}` HTML for HP stat
- Cached per-normie: mem 5min, blob `caster101-index/game/normie-{id}.json`

